  "result": "Excellent! Voucher support is fully implemented and working correctly. Here's what was added:\n\n**applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount}) in src/invoices.js:**\n- Applies a fixed-amount voucher to a draft invoice only\n- Voucher reduces total after VAT (order: subtotal \u2192 discount \u2192 VAT \u2192 voucher \u2192 total)\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) with invoice.voucher = { code, amount }\n- One voucher per invoice maximum\n- Error codes:\n  - NOT_DRAFT: only applies to draft invoices\n  - VOUCHER_EXISTS: one voucher per invoice\n  - AMOUNT_INVALID: amount must be positive integer (in cents)\n- Never mutates input invoice\n\n**Updated invoiceTotals(invoice):**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- voucher = 0 if no voucher applied\n- total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n- Clamped at 0\n\n**Error codes added:**\n- VOUCHER_EXISTS: \"Invoice can only have one voucher.\"\n\n**Calculation order (correct precedence):**\n1. Start with subtotal (sum of line totals)\n2. Apply line discounts (per item %)\n3. Add VAT (on discounted amounts)\n4. Apply voucher (fixed amount, after VAT)\n5. Clamp at 0\n\n**Example:**\n```\nSubtotal: \u20ac1,200.00\n10% discount: -\u20ac120.00\nVAT (21%): +\u20ac226.80 (on \u20ac1,080)\nSubtotal after VAT: \u20ac1,306.80\n\nVoucher: -\u20ac200.00\nFinal Total: \u20ac1,106.80\n```\n\n**Tests (7 new tests):**\n- Applying voucher to draft invoice\n- Voucher in invoiceTotals\n- Complex calculation with discount + VAT + voucher\n- Error cases: non-draft, existing voucher, invalid amount\n- Non-mutation verification\n\nAll 150 tests pass.",
